# es\utility_scripts\timed_block.esu
#
# A platform on a timer, one of a row the players jump across: the
# encounter that holds the row cycles each block (it comes up, rises,
# holds, sinks and is gone a while), so the blocks come up in turn. No
# build has its source; its only row is the block. Written from the
# Shattered Coast tower's chasm in one retail capture of mission_traitor
# (unknown_4c527387).

object o_block
